1
00:06:15,000 --> 00:06:21,000
If There Be Thorns is a tv movie, thriller, drama film directed by Nancy Savoca.

2
00:12:30,000 --> 00:12:36,000
Christopher and Cathy Dollanganger live together as man and wife with Cathy's two sons
who are unaware of the incestuous nature of their parents' relationship.

3
00:18:45,000 --> 00:18:51,000
But when a mysterious woman moves in next door and befriends the younger boy, Bart, he begins a
strange transformation and displays accusatory behavior towards Cathy and Christopher.

4
00:25:00,000 --> 00:25:06,000
When Christopher discovers their mysterious neighbor is, in fact, his mother Corrine
Dollanganger, all of the family's long-hidden secrets are revealed in a tragic climax.

5
00:31:15,000 --> 00:31:21,000
Corrine, played by Heather Graham.

6
00:37:30,000 --> 00:37:36,000
Cathy, played by Rachael Carpani.

7
00:43:45,000 --> 00:43:51,000
Christopher, played by Jason Lewis.

8
00:50:00,000 --> 00:50:06,000
Bart, played by Mason Cook.

9
00:56:15,000 --> 00:56:21,000
