11
01:08:45,000 --> 01:08:51,000
If There Be Thorns is a 2015 television film based on the
best-selling 1981 novel of the same name.

12
01:15:00,000 --> 01:15:06,000
It premiered on April 5, 2015, and was produced by Lifetime.

13
01:21:15,000 --> 01:21:21,000
